  unitName: Loch
  unitId: 40162
  unitNumber: 248
  description: One of the four legendary warriors who fought to save the Kingdom
    of Palmyna. The son of a sword instructor to the Palmyna Royal Family, Loch despaired
    at his lack of natural talent for the sword, and ran away from home. Ironically,
    his efforts to survive in the wild forced him to develop a talent for archery
    instead. After hearing that his childhood crush, Princess Edea, had embarked
    on a mission to defeat the gods, he decided to return home to Palmyna.
  summonDesc: "You need my strength, right?<br>That\u2019s fine by me, I guess.<br>I\u2019ve
    got no reason to turn you down."
  fusionDesc: "You can make me stronger, you say?<br>I\u2019m in need of all the
    power<br>I can get..."
